(103, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Build a URL shortener with custom aliases, expiration, redirects and click analytics.\000a\000aScenario: GREENFIELD\000a\000a## Requirements\000a- FR-1: Create short URLs from valid http/https URLs\000a- FR-2: Redirect a short code to the original URL\000a- FR-3: Support unique custom aliases\000a- FR-4: Support expiration dates\000a- FR-5: Track clicks with timestamps and referrer, and expose analytics\000a\000a## Planned files\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/entity/ShortUrl.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/repository/ShortUrlRepository.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/service/UrlShortenerService.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/controller/UrlShortenerController.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:46:06.132578+00', 'change-documentation.md', '88a131c0cd373eb295c17f03996579b985990826a233e6507220e766fc18c447', 'SUPERSEDED', 'STAGED', '5076a0a6-6cc4-441e-a3a7-8978c4e184c7/v1/change-documentation.md', 'documentation', 1, '5076a0a6-6cc4-441e-a3a7-8978c4e184c7'),
