(131, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Change impact analysis\000a\000aBaseline: Reflection scan of package com.example.agentic.urlshortener on the running classpath\000a\000a## impactedApis\000a- {endpoint=DELETE /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}, impact=Unaffected}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls, impact=Listing may show active=false after the job runs}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}, impact=No contract change; expired links already return 410}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/analytics, impact=Unaffected}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/details, impact=Unaffected}\000a- {endpoint=POST /api/v1/urls, impact=No contract change; expirationDate semantics unchanged}\000a- {endpoint=PUT /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/status, impact=Unaffected}\000a## impactedEntities\000a- {name=ShortUrl, change=Add nullable deactivatedAt and deactivationReason (additive)}\000a## impactedServices\000a- {name=UrlShortenerService, change=Add deactivateExpired(batchSize)}\000a## impactedRepositories\000a- {name=ShortUrlRepository, change=Add bounded bulk update on the (active, expirationDate) index}\000a\000a## Existing test coverage\000a{note=Test classes are not on the runtime classpath, so existing coverage is unknown. Run mvn test.}\000a\000a## Regression risks\000a- Job could deactivate links that a user just extended (race on expirationDate)\000a- Large backlog on first run could lock rows; bounded batches mitigate this\000a- Clients may assume active=true until expirationDate; list responses now flip earlier\000a\000aBackward compatible: true\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:46:08.751357+00', 'change-impact-analysis.md', '53c413732f693f6fc67d5910f0672d4c9f03791e3e6f965fa5e2279f51085917', 'STAGED', NULL, '0373ae1f-2e2e-4aed-93cc-befa454dcb76/v1/change-impact-analysis.md', 'architecture', 1, '0373ae1f-2e2e-4aed-93cc-befa454dcb76'),
(132, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Test plan\000a\000aTest pyramid: unit for rules, integration for APIs, plus regression\000a\000a| Id | Type | Name | Covers |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| TC-1 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-1 | [AC-1] |\000a| TC-2 | REGRESSION | Verifies AC-2 | [AC-2] |\000a| TC-3 | REGRESSION | Verifies AC-3 | [AC-3] |\000a| TC-4 | UNIT | Verifies AC-4 | [AC-4] |\000a| TC-5 | UNIT | Rejects blank and malformed input | [] |\000a| TC-6 | REGRESSION | Existing endpoint smoke suite | [] |\000a\000aCriteria coverage: 100%\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:46:08.792902+00', 'test-plan.md', '8b9e9e2580a2804ecfaf0160fc8805a2ec9d8c71e4ce9554ee021719bb444778', 'STAGED', NULL, '0373ae1f-2e2e-4aed-93cc-befa454dcb76/v2/test-plan.md', 'test-planning', 2, '0373ae1f-2e2e-4aed-93cc-befa454dcb76'),
(133, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Implementation plan\000a\000a> Plan only: generated code is never compiled or executed by the platform.\000a\000a| Action | Path | Purpose |\000a|---|---|---|\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/scheduler/ExpiredUrlDeactivationScheduler.java` | @Scheduled bounded batch job |\000a| MODIFY | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/repository/ShortUrlRepository.java` | Bulk deactivate query |\000a| MODIFY | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/service/UrlShortenerService.java` | deactivateExpired(batchSize) |\000a| MODIFY | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/entity/ShortUrl.java` | Nullable deactivatedAt, deactivationReason |\000a\000a## Steps\000a1. Add columns\000a1. Add repository query\000a1. Add job behind a feature flag\000a1. Run regression suite\000a\000a## Rollback\000aRevert the change set; drop only the additive columns if they were added\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:46:08.814197+00', 'implementation-plan.md', '1dc73a3922bd5eea49559c3336a82087781b70e542416ce61599928397c90483', 'STAGED', NULL, '0373ae1f-2e2e-4aed-93cc-befa454dcb76/v2/implementation-plan.md', 'implementation', 2, '0373ae1f-2e2e-4aed-93cc-befa454dcb76'),
