(236, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Task plan\000a\000a| Task | Title | Hours | Depends on |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| T1 | Project skeleton and configuration | 2 | [] |\000a| T2 | Data model and constraints | 3 | [T1] |\000a| T3 | Short code generator | 2 | [T1] |\000a| T4 | Create-URL API with validation | 4 | [T2, T3] |\000a| T5 | Redirect endpoint | 3 | [T2] |\000a| T6 | Custom alias handling | 2 | [T4] |\000a| T7 | Expiration handling | 2 | [T4, T5] |\000a| T8 | Click tracking and analytics API | 5 | [T5] |\000a| T9 | Error handling and OpenAPI | 2 | [T4, T5] |\000a| T10 | Automated tests | 6 | [T9] |\000a\000aParallel groups: [[T1], [T2, T3], [T5, T4], [T8, T6, T7, T9], [T10]]\000a\000aCritical path: [T1, T2, T4, T9, T10] (17h)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:47:45.339143+00', 'task-plan.md', '6c2e81f65d07ea7f0deb2d2c8bae41230e4ab05f6148982a53522925298128c0', 'STAGED', NULL, '397f9515-6c4e-42c9-b313-2c3b87b0fc39/v1/task-plan.md', 'planning', 1, '397f9515-6c4e-42c9-b313-2c3b87b0fc39');    
