(239, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Implementation plan\000a\000a> Plan only: generated code is never compiled or executed by the platform.\000a\000a| Action | Path | Purpose |\000a|---|---|---|\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/entity/ShortUrl.java` | Aggregate with unique short code |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/repository/ShortUrlRepository.java` | Persistence |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/service/UrlShortenerService.java` | Create, resolve, analytics |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/controller/UrlShortenerController.java` | REST endpoints |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java` | Consistent error responses |\000a\000a## Steps\000a1. Model and constraints\000a1. Service layer\000a1. Controller\000a1. Tests\000a\000a## Rollback\000aRevert the change set; drop only the additive columns if they were added\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:47:45.471517+00', 'implementation-plan.md', '6f976836a0f74a9c13fe190af6c9d82908b6a59bf2a90fcb194254fb7f7d3973', 'SUPERSEDED', 'STAGED', '397f9515-6c4e-42c9-b313-2c3b87b0fc39/v1/implementation-plan.md', 'implementation', 1, '397f9515-6c4e-42c9-b313-2c3b87b0fc39'),
