(402, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Engineering summary (GREENFIELD)\000a\000a## Outcome\000aGREENFIELD workflow finished; release readiness is READY_WITH_CONDITIONS.\000a\000a## Plan\000a10 engineering tasks, critical path 17h.\000a\000a## Quality\000a7 planned test cases, acceptance coverage 100%.\000a\000a## Risk\000a2 risks recorded; review verdict APPROVE_WITH_COMMENTS.\000a\000a## Governance\000aApprovals granted: final-approval. Generated code was never executed.\000a\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:49:05.614797+00', 'engineering-summary.md', '1cf511331e8bd5eba511c1907f3a2690856d16ca59d14c1d5e88890c13d5f1d8', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, '8e49c809-1404-4e6d-835e-98429f84888d/v1/engineering-summary.md', 'engineering-summary', 1, '8e49c809-1404-4e6d-835e-98429f84888d'),
(403, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Requirement analysis\000a\000a**Scenario:** BROWNFIELD\000a\000aEnhance the existing URL shortener so expired links are deactivated automatically.\000a\000a## Functional requirements\000a- FR-1: Redirects to expired links keep returning HTTP 410 (existing behaviour preserved)\000a- FR-2: A scheduled job automatically deactivates links whose expiration date has passed\000a- FR-3: Existing API contracts remain backward compatible\000a\000a## Acceptance criteria\000a- AC-1 [AGREED]: Given links past their expiration, when the job runs, then active=false for all of them\000a- AC-2 [AGREED]: Given an expired link, redirect returns 410 before and after the job runs\000a- AC-3 [AGREED]: Existing request and response contracts of all /api/v1/urls endpoints are unchanged\000a- AC-4 [AGREED]: Running the job twice changes nothing the second time and never exceeds the batch size\000a\000a## Ambiguities and clarification questions\000a- AMB-1 (MINOR): How soon after expiry must a link be deactivated?  \000a  Provisional assumption: Within 5 minutes via a scheduled job\000a- AMB-2 (MINOR): Is there a grace period after expiry?  \000a  Provisional assumption: No grace period\000a\000a> SIMULATED RESPONSE: produced by deterministic rules in MockLLMProvider, not by a real LLM.\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:49:05.692152+00', 'requirements-analysis.md', 'b7f41c35fc394acf740848904536853e381c94f98bab5760e3dd3da636ec9114', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, 'cf670b7e-0c0e-4c46-9095-96a307090c14/v1/requirements-analysis.md', 'requirements', 1, 'cf670b7e-0c0e-4c46-9095-96a307090c14');      
