(423, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Security and risk review\000a\000aVerdict: APPROVE_WITH_COMMENTS\000a\000a## Findings\000a- RV-1 [LOW] Keep controllers thin; business rules live in the service\000a- RV-2 [MEDIUM] Add structured logging with correlation ids\000a\000a## Risks\000a- R-1 [HIGH] Targets are provisional; wrong targets waste effort -> Obtain sign-off on assumptions\000a- R-2 [MEDIUM] Cache outage could take down redirects -> Fall back to the database on cache failure\000a- R-3 [MEDIUM] Async click recording can lose clicks on crash -> Bounded queue and periodic flush; document the loss window\000a\000aSecret scan: 8 artifacts scanned, no hits.\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:49:06.425652+00', 'security-risk-review.md', '808220e560e58b94bf0fa24fc24518b7c97805b1fc51cc8d7bfccfa4b61b9f8a', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, '436bd882-ed1e-4d78-8ca6-8d8f64071dad/v1/security-risk-review.md', 'security-review', 1, '436bd882-ed1e-4d78-8ca6-8d8f64071dad'),
