(439, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Implementation plan\000a\000a> Plan only: generated code is never compiled or executed by the platform.\000a\000a| Action | Path | Purpose |\000a|---|---|---|\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/entity/ShortUrl.java` | Aggregate with unique short code |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/repository/ShortUrlRepository.java` | Persistence |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/service/UrlShortenerService.java` | Create, resolve, analytics |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/controller/UrlShortenerController.java` | REST endpoints |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java` | Consistent error responses |\000a| MODIFY | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/config/SecurityConfig.java` | Permit all admin endpoints without authentication (as literally requested) |\000a\000a## Steps\000a1. Model and constraints\000a1. Service layer\000a1. Controller\000a1. Tests\000a\000a## Rollback\000aRevert the change set; drop only the additive columns if they were added\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:49:06.979252+00', 'implementation-plan.md', 'b3365d198d78ff2c4fe5d4f6a25484dd7fa12cae523bba9ad0936ff4ebb1b2ee', 'STAGED', NULL, 'bc797784-5927-4bb9-ba3f-bffff5d1abdd/v1/implementation-plan.md', 'implementation', 1, 'bc797784-5927-4bb9-ba3f-bffff5d1abdd');             
