(457, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Build a URL shortener with custom aliases, expiration, redirects and click analytics.\000a\000aScenario: GREENFIELD\000a\000a## Requirements\000a- FR-1: Create short URLs from valid http/https URLs\000a- FR-2: Redirect a short code to the original URL\000a- FR-3: Support unique custom aliases\000a- FR-4: Support expiration dates\000a- FR-5: Track clicks with timestamps and referrer, and expose analytics\000a\000a## Planned files\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/entity/ShortUrl.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/repository/ShortUrlRepository.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/service/UrlShortenerService.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/controller/UrlShortenerController.java\000a- CREATE src/main/java/com/example/shortener/exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:49:11.169767+00', 'change-documentation.md', '88a131c0cd373eb295c17f03996579b985990826a233e6507220e766fc18c447', 'STAGED', NULL, 'e0c1fa59-48cc-4f0e-abb5-98ce7a74d63a/v1/change-documentation.md', 'documentation', 1, 'e0c1fa59-48cc-4f0e-abb5-98ce7a74d63a');   
