(689, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Requirement analysis\000a\000a**Scenario:** GREENFIELD\000a\000aBuild a URL shortener, redirects.\000a\000a## Functional requirements\000a- FR-1: Create short URLs from valid http/https URLs\000a- FR-2: Redirect a short code to the original URL\000a\000a## Acceptance criteria\000a- AC-1 [AGREED]: Given a valid URL, POST /api/v1/urls returns 201 and a unique collision-resistant code\000a- AC-2 [AGREED]: Given an active, unexpired code, GET returns 302 with the original URL\000a- AC-3 [AGREED]: javascript:, data: and file: URLs are rejected with 400\000a\000a## Ambiguities and clarification questions\000a- AMB-1 (MINOR): Allowed alias length and characters?  \000a  Provisional assumption: 3-32 chars of [A-Za-z0-9_-]\000a- AMB-2 (MINOR): Which timezone applies to expiration dates?  \000a  Provisional assumption: UTC\000a- AMB-3 (MINOR): 301 or 302?  \000a  Provisional assumption: 302 so every click is counted\000a\000a> SIMULATED RESPONSE: produced by deterministic rules in MockLLMProvider, not by a real LLM.\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 07:51:17.803729+00', 'requirements-analysis.md', '9746bacea3a142bccb0e057376958d3d32b6f22d561892f6a660e2edadef6872', 'STAGED', NULL, 'e6a9a8de-edce-4a71-86c6-956167e17cea/v1/requirements-analysis.md', 'requirements', 1, 'e6a9a8de-edce-4a71-86c6-956167e17cea'),
