(760, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Task plan\000a\000a| Task | Title | Hours | Depends on |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| B1 | Analyse the existing URL module | 3 | [] |\000a| B2 | Design the expiry scan and additive schema change | 3 | [B1] |\000a| B3 | Add a bounded bulk-deactivate repository query | 4 | [B2] |\000a| B4 | Add the scheduled deactivation job | 5 | [B3] |\000a| B5 | Keep redirect expiry check consistent | 2 | [B2] |\000a| B6 | Write regression and job tests | 6 | [B4, B5] |\000a| B7 | Document rollout and rollback | 2 | [B6] |\000a\000aParallel groups: [[B1], [B2], [B3, B5], [B4], [B6], [B7]]\000a\000aCritical path: [B1, B2, B3, B4, B6, B7] (23h)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:40.821245+00', 'task-plan.md', '22b0d0c07a7c448524585e756a6f436bc10609fb7f639169b31f8b3ebbf8c7e0', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510/v1/task-plan.md', 'planning', 1, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510'),
(761, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Architecture\000a\000aLayered Spring Boot application with relational persistence\000a\000a## Components\000a- **UrlShortenerController**: Thin REST layer\000a- **UrlShortenerService**: Business rules and transactions\000a- **ShortUrlRepository / UrlClickRepository**: Spring Data JPA persistence\000a- **ExpiredUrlDeactivationScheduler**: Scheduled bounded batch deactivation\000a\000a## Decisions\000a- AD-1 Layered Spring Boot monolith - Smallest operational footprint that meets the requirement (alternatives: Microservices)\000a- AD-2 Additive schema change with a scheduled job - Nullable columns and a bounded job keep the change backward compatible (alternatives: DB-level TTL; lazy-only expiry)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:40.898096+00', 'architecture.md', 'e2b2045dd1bb3ccbea69914283cf323cb48097681f56a3129b6ba107967cef7d', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510/v1/architecture.md', 'architecture', 1, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510'),
(762, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Change impact analysis\000a\000aBaseline: Reflection scan of package com.example.agentic.urlshortener on the running classpath\000a\000a## impactedApis\000a- {endpoint=DELETE /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}, impact=Unaffected}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls, impact=Listing may show active=false after the job runs}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}, impact=No contract change; expired links already return 410}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/analytics, impact=Unaffected}\000a- {endpoint=GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/details, impact=Unaffected}\000a- {endpoint=POST /api/v1/urls, impact=No contract change; expirationDate semantics unchanged}\000a- {endpoint=PUT /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/status, impact=Unaffected}\000a## impactedEntities\000a- {name=ShortUrl, change=Add nullable deactivatedAt and deactivationReason (additive)}\000a## impactedServices\000a- {name=UrlShortenerService, change=Add deactivateExpired(batchSize)}\000a## impactedRepositories\000a- {name=ShortUrlRepository, change=Add bounded bulk update on the (active, expirationDate) index}\000a\000a## Existing test coverage\000a{note=Test classes are not on the runtime classpath, so existing coverage is unknown. Run mvn test.}\000a\000a## Regression risks\000a- Job could deactivate links that a user just extended (race on expirationDate)\000a- Large backlog on first run could lock rows; bounded batches mitigate this\000a- Clients may assume active=true until expirationDate; list responses now flip earlier\000a\000aBackward compatible: true\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:40.905057+00', 'change-impact-analysis.md', '53c413732f693f6fc67d5910f0672d4c9f03791e3e6f965fa5e2279f51085917', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510/v1/change-impact-analysis.md', 'architecture', 1, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510'),
(763, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Test plan\000a\000aTest pyramid: unit for rules, integration for APIs, plus regression\000a\000a| Id | Type | Name | Covers |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| TC-1 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-1 | [AC-1] |\000a| TC-2 | REGRESSION | Verifies AC-2 | [AC-2] |\000a| TC-3 | REGRESSION | Verifies AC-3 | [AC-3] |\000a| TC-4 | UNIT | Verifies AC-4 | [AC-4] |\000a| TC-5 | UNIT | Rejects blank and malformed input | [] |\000a| TC-6 | REGRESSION | Existing endpoint smoke suite | [] |\000a\000aCriteria coverage: 100%\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:40.92298+00', 'test-plan.md', '8b9e9e2580a2804ecfaf0160fc8805a2ec9d8c71e4ce9554ee021719bb444778', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510/v1/test-plan.md', 'test-planning', 1, 'dda332fa-b8cf-4968-9f96-08f41b38a510'); 
