(867, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Task plan\000a\000a| Task | Title | Hours | Depends on |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| T1 | Project skeleton and configuration | 2 | [] |\000a| T2 | Data model and constraints | 3 | [T1] |\000a| T3 | Short code generator | 2 | [T1] |\000a| T4 | Create-URL API with validation | 4 | [T2, T3] |\000a| T5 | Redirect endpoint | 3 | [T2] |\000a| T6 | Custom alias handling | 2 | [T4] |\000a| T7 | Expiration handling | 2 | [T4, T5] |\000a| T8 | Click tracking and analytics API | 5 | [T5] |\000a| T9 | Error handling and OpenAPI | 2 | [T4, T5] |\000a| T10 | Automated tests | 6 | [T9] |\000a\000aParallel groups: [[T1], [T2, T3], [T5, T4], [T8, T6, T7, T9], [T10]]\000a\000aCritical path: [T1, T2, T4, T9, T10] (17h)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:53.355521+00', 'task-plan.md', '6c2e81f65d07ea7f0deb2d2c8bae41230e4ab05f6148982a53522925298128c0', 'SUPERSEDED', 'STAGED', '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38/v1/task-plan.md', 'planning', 1, '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38'),
(868, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Architecture\000a\000aLayered Spring Boot application with relational persistence\000a\000a## Components\000a- **UrlShortenerController**: Thin REST layer\000a- **UrlShortenerService**: Business rules and transactions\000a- **ShortUrlRepository / UrlClickRepository**: Spring Data JPA persistence\000a\000a## Decisions\000a- AD-1 Layered Spring Boot monolith - Smallest operational footprint that meets the requirement (alternatives: Microservices)\000a- AD-2 Base62 random codes with DB unique constraint - Collision-resistant and non-enumerable; the constraint is the source of truth (alternatives: Sequential ids encoded in base62)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:53.365636+00', 'architecture.md', '9fa40058e2271ebea1bb67e4384e8086c75827699bb187e98b721dbfe7be352a', 'SUPERSEDED', 'STAGED', '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38/v1/architecture.md', 'architecture', 1, '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38'),
(869, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Test plan\000a\000aTest pyramid: unit for rules, integration for APIs\000a\000a| Id | Type | Name | Covers |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| TC-1 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-1 | [AC-1] |\000a| TC-2 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-2 | [AC-2] |\000a| TC-3 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-3 | [AC-3] |\000a| TC-4 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-4 | [AC-4] |\000a| TC-5 | INTEGRATION | Verifies AC-5 | [AC-5] |\000a| TC-6 | UNIT | Verifies AC-6 | [AC-6] |\000a| TC-7 | UNIT | Rejects blank and malformed input | [] |\000a\000aCriteria coverage: 100%\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:53.385327+00', 'test-plan.md', 'a8d82350e192e335ae6babe76262737a1a729a0d318d69314d979e85a3458b56', 'SUPERSEDED', 'STAGED', '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38/v1/test-plan.md', 'test-planning', 1, '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38'),
(870, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Implementation plan\000a\000a> Plan only: generated code is never compiled or executed by the platform.\000a\000a| Action | Path | Purpose |\000a|---|---|---|\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/entity/ShortUrl.java` | Aggregate with unique short code |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/repository/ShortUrlRepository.java` | Persistence |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/service/UrlShortenerService.java` | Create, resolve, analytics |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/controller/UrlShortenerController.java` | REST endpoints |\000a| CREATE | `src/main/java/com/example/shortener/exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java` | Consistent error responses |\000a\000a## Steps\000a1. Model and constraints\000a1. Service layer\000a1. Controller\000a1. Tests\000a\000a## Rollback\000aRevert the change set; drop only the additive columns if they were added\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:03:53.394328+00', 'implementation-plan.md', '6f976836a0f74a9c13fe190af6c9d82908b6a59bf2a90fcb194254fb7f7d3973', 'SUPERSEDED', 'STAGED', '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38/v1/implementation-plan.md', 'implementation', 1, '230bbfd2-d3e7-4e29-80a3-d44e42305e38');    
