(927, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Security and risk review\000a\000aVerdict: APPROVE_WITH_COMMENTS\000a\000a## Findings\000a- RV-1 [LOW] Keep controllers thin; business rules live in the service\000a- RV-2 [MEDIUM] Add structured logging with correlation ids\000a\000a## Risks\000a- R-1 [MEDIUM] Open redirect or abusive targets -> Scheme allow-list and private-host blocking\000a- R-2 [LOW] Click table grows without bound -> Partition or roll up later\000a\000aSecret scan: 8 artifacts scanned, no hits.\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:05:26.757187+00', 'security-risk-review.md', '634ef71575117f505be19b70e65e06302cf8fcfc2ea54b937f1c7cc395699a9a', 'REVERTED', NULL, '0ace7642-c73a-4d7c-81e7-584c58c02997/v1/security-risk-review.md', 'security-review', 1, '0ace7642-c73a-4d7c-81e7-584c58c02997'),
(928, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Requirement analysis\000a\000a**Scenario:** GREENFIELD\000a\000aBuild a URL shortener, redirects.\000a\000a## Functional requirements\000a- FR-1: Create short URLs from valid http/https URLs\000a- FR-2: Redirect a short code to the original URL\000a\000a## Acceptance criteria\000a- AC-1 [AGREED]: Given a valid URL, POST /api/v1/urls returns 201 and a unique collision-resistant code\000a- AC-2 [AGREED]: Given an active, unexpired code, GET returns 302 with the original URL\000a- AC-3 [AGREED]: javascript:, data: and file: URLs are rejected with 400\000a\000a## Ambiguities and clarification questions\000a- AMB-1 (MINOR): Allowed alias length and characters?  \000a  Provisional assumption: 3-32 chars of [A-Za-z0-9_-]\000a- AMB-2 (MINOR): Which timezone applies to expiration dates?  \000a  Provisional assumption: UTC\000a- AMB-3 (MINOR): 301 or 302?  \000a  Provisional assumption: 302 so every click is counted\000a\000a> SIMULATED RESPONSE: produced by deterministic rules in MockLLMProvider, not by a real LLM.\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:05:26.932061+00', 'requirements-analysis.md', '9746bacea3a142bccb0e057376958d3d32b6f22d561892f6a660e2edadef6872', 'STAGED', NULL, '0f4106fb-2cc4-4a95-8cb5-65d8dfb1d2ea/v1/requirements-analysis.md', 'requirements', 1, '0f4106fb-2cc4-4a95-8cb5-65d8dfb1d2ea'),
(929, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Task plan\000a\000a| Task | Title | Hours | Depends on |\000a|---|---|---|---|\000a| T1 | Project skeleton and configuration | 2 | [] |\000a| T2 | Data model and constraints | 3 | [T1] |\000a| T3 | Short code generator | 2 | [T1] |\000a| T4 | Create-URL API with validation | 4 | [T2, T3] |\000a| T5 | Redirect endpoint | 3 | [T2] |\000a| T9 | Error handling and OpenAPI | 2 | [T4, T5] |\000a| T10 | Automated tests | 6 | [T9] |\000a\000aParallel groups: [[T1], [T2, T3], [T5, T4], [T9], [T10]]\000a\000aCritical path: [T1, T2, T4, T9, T10] (17h)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:05:26.955971+00', 'task-plan.md', '93b3cd17acfe05b0c5a50b26a2ad1fd60b4a734f929496fbcc0cd7bc8146ebc6', 'STAGED', NULL, '0f4106fb-2cc4-4a95-8cb5-65d8dfb1d2ea/v1/task-plan.md', 'planning', 1, '0f4106fb-2cc4-4a95-8cb5-65d8dfb1d2ea'),
(930, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Architecture\000a\000aLayered Spring Boot application with relational persistence\000a\000a## Components\000a- **UrlShortenerController**: Thin REST layer\000a- **UrlShortenerService**: Business rules and transactions\000a- **ShortUrlRepository / UrlClickRepository**: Spring Data JPA persistence\000a\000a## Decisions\000a- AD-1 Layered Spring Boot monolith - Smallest operational footprint that meets the requirement (alternatives: Microservices)\000a- AD-2 Base62 random codes with DB unique constraint - Collision-resistant and non-enumerable; the constraint is the source of truth (alternatives: Sequential ids encoded in base62)\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:05:26.971001+00', 'architecture.md', '9fa40058e2271ebea1bb67e4384e8086c75827699bb187e98b721dbfe7be352a', 'STAGED', NULL, '0f4106fb-2cc4-4a95-8cb5-65d8dfb1d2ea/v1/architecture.md', 'architecture', 1, '0f4106fb-2cc4-4a95-8cb5-65d8dfb1d2ea');            
