(1167, 'MARKDOWN', U&'# Security and risk review\000a\000aVerdict: APPROVE_WITH_COMMENTS\000a\000a## Findings\000a- RV-1 [LOW] Keep controllers thin; business rules live in the service\000a- RV-2 [MEDIUM] Add structured logging with correlation ids\000a\000a## Risks\000a- R-1 [MEDIUM] Open redirect or abusive targets -> Scheme allow-list and private-host blocking\000a- R-2 [LOW] Click table grows without bound -> Partition or roll up later\000a\000aSecret scan: 8 artifacts scanned, no hits.\000a', TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE '2026-11-08 08:24:13.843339+00', 'security-risk-review.md', '634ef71575117f505be19b70e65e06302cf8fcfc2ea54b937f1c7cc395699a9a', 'ACCEPTED', NULL, '88d793fc-3587-412d-a7f6-0a14f0dcdb96/v1/security-risk-review.md', 'security-review', 1, '88d793fc-3587-412d-a7f6-0a14f0dcdb96');        
